## Installer

The installer is built with NSIS through the Tauri bundler. It contains the NSIS installer stub
and plug-ins, and Tauri's `nsis_tauri_utils` plug-in (MIT OR Apache-2.0, part of the Tauri
project, whose license texts are the ones of the `tauri` crates below). When the WebView2
Runtime is missing, the installer downloads Microsoft's WebView2 bootstrapper at install time;
it is not part of the installer and comes under Microsoft's own license terms.

